      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُلَّفٌ</span></b>  [a pl. of which the sing. is not mentioned: accord. to general analogy, the sing.
should be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَالِفٌ</span>]. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُلُوفٌ ظُلَّفٌ</span> means <i>Hard</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُلُوف</span> [or <i>divided hoofs</i>]: (S, O, K:) the latter
word being a corroborative. (S, O.)

